Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: surface tracker blocks and add loopback CDP

Record renderer/browser intercepts in chrome://aegis, strip Referer
tracking params, label first-party cookie hits, and add an opt-in
loopback-only DevTools endpoint for local AI agents.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
